'''Nord Sledge''' is the fourth, [[Deep North]]-tier two-handed [[Clubs|club]].

* The primary attack slams the ground ''(after a lengthy swing delay)'', dealing damage, 2x the damage as staggering and knocking back everything in a spherical area of effect with a radius of 4 meters.
* It has no secondary attack.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Sledge]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Sledge''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Sledge can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Sledge}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Sledge}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

An upgraded Nord Sledge will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

